      "paragraphs": [
        "The Maple Leafs made the trip feel bigger than practice, visiting Matthew Mayich's family in Arizona before skating at Arizona State. The season opener is Tuesday night against the Canadiens at 7:00 PM ET on Sportsnet, and one focus this week is what a successful year might look like for William Nylander.",
